# Comforting Counsel: "Whenever you gain life, put a growth counter on this enchantment. As long as there are five or more
# growth counters on this enchantment, creatures you control get +3/+3." Each Healing Salve is one event. Turn 1: three Salves
# (Black Lotus) = three counters. Bot2's Salve on itself (turn 2) adds none: it is not Bot1's life. Turns 5 and 7: the fourth and
# fifth counters; Llanowar Elves (1/1) is a 1/1 at four and a 4/4 at five, and Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) is not pumped.

